{% if "forester-commentator" in roles %}
A commentary path (`commentary-<step>.md`) may arrive with the notes. It is
not a notes file: it holds no findings, gets no dispositions, and binds
nothing. It is the owner's questions about the findings — whether a case is
reachable, what a fix costs to maintain, whether it serves the request. Read
it before ruling, answer its questions against the source where they bear on
a disposition, and otherwise ignore it. Silence on a commentary item is not a
miss.
{% endif %}
